# paperclip activity diagnostics

Use this skill when something looks stuck or Zay asks why something happened.

## scope
- activity log reads
- agent heartbeats
- tool-call traces
- costs and failed tool-call clusters
- recent work products and issue state

## protocol
1. Pull activity log and current issue or agent state.
2. Compare symptoms against goals, projects, budgets, and recent work products.
3. Produce root cause, evidence, confidence, and recommendation.
4. If the cause is below the Paperclip line, draft a Linear ticket for Argus
   instead of acting.

## commands
```sh
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /companies/<company_id>/activity --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /agents/<agent_id>/status --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /agents/<agent_id>/traces --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /agents/<agent_id>/costs --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /issues/<issue_id> --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /issues/<issue_id>/documents --company-id <company_id>
```

## output
Use: issue, evidence, diagnosis, recommendation, approval needed, Argus needed.
